    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie\n\nThis two-bed, two-bathrooom extended mobile home, nestled in the tranquil surrounds of Castletown, offers a peaceful coastal escape just a short stroll from the picturesque Kilmichael Point and its beautiful sandy strand, making it an ideal holiday home, coastal retreat, or starter residence.\n\nOccupying a generous site of approximately 0.4 acres and extending to approximately 58 sq. m., the accommodation comprises two well-appointed bedrooms, with the master bedroom benefiting from an ensuite, along with a family bathroom, comfortable living room and kitchen/dining area.\n\nApproached via a gravel driveway with ample parking for several vehicles, the property enjoys generous outdoor space. To the rear, an extensive lawn is framed by mature hedging and trees, creating a wonderful sense of privacy, tranquility, and seclusion.\n\nThe location is truly exceptional. Stunning coastal scenery, unspoilt beaches, and scenic walks are all within easy walking distance, offering the very best of seaside living. Castletown Village is close at hand and provides a range of everyday amenities, while the thriving towns of Gorey and Arklow are just a short drive away. Excellent connectivity is assured with convenient access to the M11 motorway."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.3m x 1.2m\n\n\nLiving Room - 3.0m x 3.9m\n\n\nKitchen/Dining - 2.9m x 3.9m\n\n\nBathroom - 1.8m x 2.6m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.4m x 2.6m\n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 4.1m x 3.9m\nat widest point\n\nEnsuite - 2.7m x 0.9m\n\n\n"
      },
